    "notes": "A GeckoLib animation set: named animations that move bones of the geo model. Each animation has a length in seconds and loop true repeats it. Under bones, each bone name has rotation, position or scale channels, keyed by time in seconds; values between keyframes are blended linearly. walk swings the legs and arms 30 and 25 degrees about x, the opposite way on each side, once a second. The entity plays idle while standing and walk while moving.",
